      "date": "2026-02-16T08:19:13.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹7.77 (vs ₹17.20 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹7.77 (down from ₹17.20 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹240.6m (up 4.7% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹27.8m (down 55% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 12% (down from 27% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 31% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 24% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
